7: ERROR: `a*->b` — there is no `*->` operator: `*-` (the total collapse) attaches at the END of a segment, and `->` is the function arrow, which means nothing inside a selection. If you meant the total collapse, end the segment there and write what follows as its own branch: `a*- b`
